{
  "source_repository": "https://github.com/forecastingresearch/forecastbench-sim",
  "source_branch": "freeciv-v3",
  "source_commit": "daca5a15af759f4124960e30694bff15256b7f5d",
  "author": "Jaeho Lee and contributors",
  "license": "GPL-3.0 (repository LICENSE)",
  "excluded": [
    "question sets, world reports, model panels, launch scripts and run records (forecastbench-sim-paper production/freeciv)",
    "paper analysis and generators (forecastbench-sim-paper src/fbsim_paper/assets/freeciv)",
    "raw responses, scores and replay data (private data archive)",
    "the pod bundle's vendored fbsim-core, pyproject.toml and uv.lock (production/freeciv; built from this repository instead)",
    "freeciv_world_as_run.patch (applied to worlds/freeciv; the file itself is in production/freeciv)",
    "logprob comparison, smoke reports, cost and cache probes, dated manuscript-editing scripts"
  ],
  "adaptations": [
    "Question sets, reports and model panels read from FBSIM_FREECIV_V3_DATA (default: this folder) instead of the producer checkout (run/elicit_v1.py, elicit_v2.py, elicit_natcond_v1.py, effort_check_v2.py, score_v1.py, score_v2.py, selection_fractions.py)",
    "API keys from the environment or the repository's credentials/.env, never from a file in this folder (run/elicit_v1.py, elicit_v2.py, elicit_natcond_v1.py, effort_check_v2.py, fleet/rp.sh); --env-file removed",
    "Runs: one folder per configuration, data/freeciv/fbsim_v3/runs/<run>/ with a run.env (fleet/1_new_run.sh); FBSIM_RUN or --run selects it. Fleet state (ledger, queues, anchors) in <run>/fleet_state, pods named fbsim3-<run>-..., archive under /vol/fbsim_v3/<run>/, run.env shipped to pods (fleet/paths.sh, sourced by every fleet script); ssh keys in credentials/freeciv; pods record games under data/freeciv/logs",
    "Fork turn, horizons, player count, barbarians and natural conditionals from the run's run.env instead of literals (runcfg.py; draw/bank_v1.py, sweep_v4.py, draw_v1.py, criteria_v1.py, regen_reports.py, consolidate_v4.py, corpus_qc.py, anchor_qc.py, make_queue.py; run/elicit_v1.py, elicit_v2.py, elicit_natcond_v1.py, score_v2.py; fleet/pull.sh, pull2.sh, bringup.sh, switch_anchor.sh, launch_workers.sh, on_pod/anchor_one.sh, anchors_run.sh, worker.sh, rerun_list.sh, pod_bundle/fork_one.sh). Without a run the paper's values apply and the outputs are unchanged",
    "draw/norm_constants_v1.py added: writes continuous_norm_constants.json by the paper's rule (reproduces the paper's file)",
    "Numbered step scripts added (fleet/1_new_run.sh ... 9_score.sh, steps_lib.sh, on_pod/anchor_status.sh): one per step of a run, run name as first argument; new_run.sh renamed 1_new_run.sh and records the run's pod machines and network volume in run.env",
    "Producer paths replaced by arguments or environment variables (draw/qc_pipeline.py, draw/regen_reports.py, draw/sg_tables.py, fleet/pull.sh, fleet/pull2.sh, fleet/exhausted.sh, fleet/finalize.sh, fleet/pod_bundle/bench/test_observability.py)",
    "fleet/finalize.sh: pod ids as arguments, draw scripts called from ../draw, the legacy mine_v3.py step removed (that script was never committed)",
    "run/score_selftest.py: system temp directory",
    "fleet/make_bundle.sh added; bringup.sh builds the bundle from this repository (packages/fbsim-core, worlds/freeciv with the as-run patch applied)",
    "README.md rewritten for this repository"
  ],
